    "detailed_description": "Hack your way out of a government-controlled city in this game <i>Firewall</i>! This game follows a group of hackers, Issac, James, and Zach as they work their way out of the city. On their way to a connection point, they get attacked by the anti-rebellious forces! As they get back, they realize that James was taken away! You have to help them hack their way to finding out where James is in a Third Person Shooter style format to help them free the entire city; or just yourselves! <br>The game can be played either in first or third person and on a keyboard or controller! <br><br>    This game runs as 2 games parallel! There is the &quot;In real life&quot; portion and the &quot;Computer&quot; portion! The game is a third person shooter in the computer section and a stealth-puzzle type game when in the &quot;In Real Life&quot; portion! In the computer sections, you have health and can use Grenades, Mines, and guns such as 1911, Machine gun, AK, Sniper, and an RPG! <br>   In the &quot;In Real Life&quot; portion, you have to run away from dangers while trying to not get shot! <br><br>This game is made in Unreal Engine 5, and is a fun project I started because I was bored!",
